                        <div class="flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
                            <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="GameplayTab.grantAllTech()">📘 All Tech Recipes</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-success" onclick="GameplayTab.completeAllQuests()">🎯 Complete Main Quests</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-danger" onclick="GameplayTab.playtestSetup()">⚔️ Full Gear Setup</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-warning" onclick="GameplayTab.maxSpecializations()">⭐ Max Specializations (lvl 100)</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-info" onclick="GameplayTab.grantAllKeystones()">💎 All Keystones (205)</button>
                            <button class="btn btn-info" onclick="GameplayTab.maxFactionRep()">📊 Max Faction Rep (Tier 20)</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex gap-2 mt-2" style="align-items:center">
                            <div>
                                <label class="form-label" style="margin:0;font-size:11px;color:#ffa500">🏆 Frakcja:</label>
                                <select class="form-select" id="gpFaction" style="width:160px">
                                    <option value="2" selected>🦅 Harkonnen</option>
                                    <option value="1">🦁 Atreides</option>
                                    <option value="4">🐍 Smuggler</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <button class="btn btn-primary flex-1" onclick="GameplayTab.autoCompleteMissions()">🏆 Auto-Complete Landsraad (25/25)</button>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:10px;margin:4px 0 0 0">Daje 70000 pkt na każdy dom, ustawia progress, wkład własny, siłę głosu. Dekret aktywuje automatycznie ale TY wybierasz na który głosować w grze.</p>
                    </div>
